<title>NETHERLANDS: HOEK LOOS H1 NET RISES.</title>
<headline>HOEK LOOS H1 NET RISES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     4.62 vs   4.38</p>
<p>    Net profit			    33.40 vs  28.96</p>
<p>    Turnover			     370.10 vs 273.59</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    52.43 vs  44.42</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial gasses producer NV WA Hoek's Machine- en</p>
<p>Zuurstoffabriek (Hoek Loos) repeated its previous forecast that</p>
<p>earnings per share would grow in 1997 despite an increased</p>
<p>number of shares.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
